{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108865","id":2685681267,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gFD5z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108865","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108865.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108865.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108865","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108865/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108865/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108865/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/988c71ebb06704d67bac076e584b06c7b9e0fe77","number":108865,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix folding node in scene tree dock","user":{"login":"leon196","id":2514652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQ2NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2514652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196","html_url":"https://github.com/leon196","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leon196/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A small edit that fixes expanding a node folding in scene tree editor.\r\nThe problem was calling `set_display_folded` and emitting `editor_state_changed` was collapsing the node but not expanding it.  \r\n  \r\nWith this fix, this editor script below works:  \r\n```gdscript\r\nvar root : Node = EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root()\r\nvar nodes : Array = get_all_visible_nodes(root)\r\nfor node : Node in nodes:\r\n\tnode.set_display_folded(!node.visible)\r\n\tnode.editor_state_changed.emit()\r\n```\r\nHere's an animation of the custom tool using `set_display_folded` (folding from node visibility):  \r\n  \r\n![godot_folding_node](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c44125ef-1864-432d-b400-7a4329766759)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-m